                <pb facs="0447" n="323" sameAs="frus:frus1921v01/pg323"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.002/67: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Schurman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-12-27"><hi rendition="#italic">December 27,
                        1921</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 8:55 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>468. New Cabinet assumed office 25th: Premier, Liang Shih-yi; Foreign Affairs,
                    Yen; Finance, Chang Hu; War, Pao Kwei-ching; Navy, Li Ting-hsin; Communications,
                    Yeh Kung-cho; Justice, Wang Chung-hui; Commerce, Chi Yao-shan; Interior, Kao
                    Ling-wei; Education, Huang Yen-pei.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Schurman</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
